Subject: HID: add haptics page defines
To: stable@vger.kernel.org
Cc: Angela Czubak <aczubak@google.com>, Jonathan Denose <jdenose@google.com>, Benjamin Tissoires <bentiss@kernel.org>, Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>
